R - S - T - U - V - W - X - Y - Z", "url": "https://thailex.info/THAILEX/THAILEXENG/LEXICON/Thailand%20Lexicon%20-%20Lopburi%20(ลพบุรี).htm"}, {"title": "graphsearch.epfl.ch", "url": "https://graphsearch.epfl.ch/en/concept/22340225"}]}, "The search found consistent support that Lavo, known in Khmer as Lavodayapura, came under Khmer control in the 10th century, though the sources differ on exact dates.\n\n- **Khmer control:** One Wikipedia article on Lopburi says that in the 10th century, under the name Lavodayapura, Lavo was subordinate to the Khmer empire. A children's encyclopedia entry says Lavo was known as Lavodayapura in the 10th century and became part of the Khmer empire.\n- **Dates vary:** The Lavo Kingdom article gives a vassal period of 946–1052 for Angkor, with a Lavo-related entry noting that Lavo was destroyed by Angkor in 1001. A military history source instead dates Angkor's absorption of Lavo to around 1010–1050.\n- **Cultural impact:** Khmer rule brought changes to the city. New buildings were made using stones from older Dvaravati temples, so the oldest ruins in Lopburi often show Khmer style on Dvaravati foundations.\n- **Independence:** Lavo became separate from Cambodia by the late 13th century and started sending its own representatives to China from 1289 to 1299.\n\nSome sources are low-quality (a fan-style Wikipedia mirror and a graphic-heavy site), so the dates should be checked against academic histories before being relied on."], "durationSeconds": 5.955197792000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01QRKjZgwbkmRauQb8i7eVVj", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEM3s92JNGLjJzVCojxC", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**คำตอบ:** ในภาษาเขมร Lavo ถูกเรียกว่า **Lavodayapura** (ลวทยปุระ / លវោទយបុរ)\n\nผลค้นหาระบุว่า ในศตวรรษที่ 10 เมื่อ Lavo อยู่ใต้อำนาจของจักรวรรดิเขมร เมืองนี้ใช้ชื่อ Lavodayapura ส่วนวันเวลาที่แน่ชัดของการยอมสวามิภักดิ์ยังไม่ตรงกันในแต่ละแหล่ง ผมพบทั้ง 946–1052 และราว 1010–1050\n\nผมยืนยันชื่อนี้จากบทความวิกิพีเดียและสารานุกรมเด็ก ซึ่งเป็นแหล่งรอง ไม่ได้ตรวจกับงานวิชาการหรือจารึกโดยตรง ส่วนรูปสะกดอักษรไทยและเขมรในวงเล็บเป็นการถอดเสียงของผมเอง ไม่ได้มาจากแหล่งเหล่านี้\n\nSources:\n- [History of Lopburi (Wikipedia)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Lopburi)\n- [Lavo Kingdom (Wikipedia)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lavo_Kingdom)\n- [History of Lopburi (Kiddle)](https://kids.kiddle.co/History_of_Lopburi)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1441, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5570, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1441}, "output_tokens": 544, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:20:36.362Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEM3rrv6fZFw6p3EYhZM"}
